als a dense area of fibrosis centrally located  from which multiple blue domed cysts are identified  A representative section from the lateral aspect at the 11 o clock position is submitted in Cassette I  In the lateral aspect  at the 6 o clock position inferiorly  there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm pink  healed  retracted area possibly consistent with a previous biopsy site  which comes within 2 5cm from the closest anterior margin and 3 5cm from the closest deep margin  The area is submitted in toto in Cassette J  On a line parallel to the 6 and 12 o clock margins  there is a gritty  focally cystic REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm area  which comes within 0 7cm of the deep margin  This area is submitted entirely in Cassette K  The remaining fibrous areas are focally cystic  No additional abnormalities are noted  No lymph nodes are noted in the most lateral aspect  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast axillary contents   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm portion of adipose tissue  from which multiple lymph nodes are identified  ranging from   0 1cm in greatest dimension  up to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  A representative section from each lymph is submitted in Cassettes L O  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  SELIM NASSER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Edi Brogi  M D   PhD  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   DISSECTION   report_end  , Micro.
