t at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  13 REMOVED_MONTH 99 at 14 53 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm breast lumpectomy specimen  A long stitch marks the lateral  and a short stitch the superior margin  The specimen is inked black overall with additional colors as follows  inferior red  lateral orange  superior blue  anterior yellow  medial green and deep black  The specimen is sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm spiculated yellow white mass that grossly abuts the lateral margin  The tumor closely approaches the deep margin  however  extended invasion is difficult to evaluate as the tumor infiltrates the fibrous tissue of the deep margin and becomes mixed with it  The remaining margins  anterior  medial  inferior and superior  are grossly free of tumor  The remaining breast shows fibrous tissue with cysts at the deep margin and predominantly yellow fatty tissue in all other areas  Representative sections submitted  A B  representative inferior margin  C F  representative lateral margin  G I  representative deep margin  J K  representative medial margin  L M  representative anterior margin  N O  superior margin  P Q  additional tumor  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm mass of fibrofatty tissue identified in the requisition as right axillary contents  A firm tan white lymph node measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm is identified and a portion saved for Dr  Dennis Sgroi  Representative section submitted  R S  repres