 with the posterior surface  Focal areas of fat necrosis is present around the cavity wall  The breast parenchyma in the inner lower quadrant shows fibrous thickening which cysts averaging 0 5cm in diameter filled with blue fluid  consistent with blue domed cyst   No mass or lesion is identified in the remaining breast parenchyma  No palpable lymph nodes in the axillary portion of the specimen   Section Code   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section from the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  lower inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Axillary fat  Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Micro.
