e nipple and areola present on the anterior margin and oriented with a short stitch superiorly and a long stitch laterally  The remainder of the anterior margin consists of unremarkable yellow lobulated adipose tissue  which is now inked blue  Posterior margin consists of smooth fascia overlying fibroadipose breast tissue and is now inked black  Serial sectioning of the specimen reveals a vaguely defined area of brownish parenchyma  with focal retraction  consistent with a prior biopsy site  lying immediately adjacent to the inferior portion of the medial margin of the specimen  A dumbbell shaped 0 2cm metal clip is identified in this region  lying 0 1cm from the inked margin  inferomedial   No grossly identifiable mass is present in this area  Otherwise  the central portion of the specimen consists of moderately dense fibrous breast tissue  with more adipose predominant tissue present peripherally  including in the area of the previously mentioned clip  No additional focal lesions are noted  however  there are several small areas of vague nodularity punctate hemorrhages present in the central breast tissue  No lymph nodes are identified in the peripheral breast tissues  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections of region of clip to medial margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire inferior margin of slice immediately adjacent to region of clip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire region surrounding clip area  adjacent in consecutive sections  including inferomedial margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections from central fibrous  focally hemorrhagic areas  Received are 2 additional containers which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh  labeled  right breast skin   is a 13 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm strip of skin  which is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  left breast skin   is a 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm aggregate of skin strips  which are submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE